WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.080
What would happen if a pack of Cards Against
Humanity cards were placed into SCP-914?

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.720
A researcher placed the controversial card
game into the clockworks on “Fine”, and

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:15.660
the result was a special pack with cognitohazardous
elements that forces the player to ardently

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.910
believe in whatever strange or offensive position
appears in the cards.

